#. Tag: title
#: specials.docbook:5 specials.docbook:20
#, no-c-format
msgid "Specials and Built-in Global Variables"
msgstr "Specijalne i ugrađene globalne varijable"

#. Tag: author
#: specials.docbook:7
#, no-c-format
msgid "<firstname></firstname> <surname></surname>"
msgstr "<firstname></firstname><surname></surname>"

#. Tag: trans_comment
#: specials.docbook:15
#, no-c-format
msgid "ROLES_OF_TRANSLATORS"
msgstr "ULOGE_PREVODIOCA"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:22
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Specials are functions that are processed by &kommander;. You should be "
"aware that until &kommander; has a full parser all &kommander; specials will "
"be executed first and then the script will be executed. In most cases this "
"is not a problem, but in a few it is."
msgstr ""
"Akcije su funkcije koje su procesirane od strane  &kommander;. Vi bi trebali "
"biti svjesni da dok &kommander; ima puni parser svi &kommander; akcije će "
"biti izvršene a onda će skripta biti izvršena. U većini slučajeva to nije "
"problem, ali u nekoliko jeste."

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:28
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"@dcop(<parameter>appId</parameter>, <parameter>object</parameter>, "
"<parameter>function</parameter>, <parameter>arguments</parameter>)"
msgstr ""
"@dcop(<parameter>appId</parameter>, <parameter>object</parameter>, "
"<parameter>function</parameter>, <parameter>arguments</parameter>)"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:30
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Make a &DCOP; call. @dcop(<quote>kmail</quote>, <quote>KMailIface</quote>, "
"<quote>checkMail()</quote>, <quote></quote>)"
msgstr ""
"Napravi &DCOP; pozovi. @dcop(<quote>kmail</quote>, <quote>KMailIface</"
"quote>, <quote>checkMail()</quote>, <quote></quote>)"

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:37
#, no-c-format
msgid "@dcopid"
msgstr "@dcopid"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:39
#, no-c-format
msgid "The &DCOP; id of the process. (kmdr-executor-@pid)"
msgstr "&DCOP; ID procesa. (kmdr-executor-@pid)"

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"@dialog(<parameter>dialog</parameter>[,<parameter>parameters</parameter>])"
msgstr ""
"@dialog(<parameter>dialog</parameter>[,<parameter>parameters</parameter>])"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Launches the specified Kommander dialog. Dialog is sought in dialog "
"directory and in current directory - in that order. This prepends the call "
"to the executor and sets the default directory to the one the Kommander "
"application is in. Parameters can be passed in the usual Unix way or you can "
"pass named parameters like <quote>variable=value</quote>. You can then find "
"passed parameters in the global pool. @global(variable) would return "
"<quote>value</quote>."
msgstr ""
"Pokreće navedeni Kommander dijalog. Dijalog se traži u direktoriju dijaloga "
"i u trenutnom direktoriju - u tom poretku. Ovo prosljeđuje poziv izvršiocu i "
"postavlja defaultni direktoriji na onaj u kome je Kommander aplikacija. "
"Parametri se mogu prenositi na uobičajen Unix način ili se mogu prenositi "
"imenovani parametri kao <quote>varijabla=vrijednost</quote>. Možete  onda "
"pronaći prenesene parametre u globalnom bazenu. @global(varijabla) će "
"vratiti <quote>vrijednost</quote>."

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:55
#, no-c-format
msgid "@env(<parameter>environmentVariable</parameter>)"
msgstr "@env(<parameter>varijablaOkruženja</parameter>)"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:57
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Expands to the specified environment variable. @env(PWD) expands to $PWD. "
"Remember that <quote>$</quote> is part of the shell and shouldn't be used."
msgstr ""
"Proširuje na navedenu varijablu okruženja. @env(PWD) proširuje na $PWD. "
"Zapamtite da je <quote>$</quote>  dio ljuske i nebi trebao biti korišten."

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:64
#, no-c-format
msgid "@exec(<parameter>command</parameter>)"
msgstr "@exec(<parameter>komanda</parameter>)"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:66
#, no-c-format
msgid "returns the output of executing the specified command. @exec(ls -l)."
msgstr "vraća izlaz izvršenja navedene komande. @exec(ls -l)."

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid "@execBegin ... @execEnd"
msgstr "@execBegin ... @execEnd"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"same as <function>@exec</function>, but supports shebang and multiline "
"scripts. This serves for various scripting languages either by declaring "
"them or using a shebang."
msgstr ""
"isto kao <function>@exec</function>, ali podržava shebang i višelinijske "
"skripte. Ovo služi za razne skriptne jezike tako što ih deklarira ili "
"korištenjem shebanga."

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid "@execBegin(php)"
msgstr "@execBegin(php)"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid "<function>@execBegin</function>#!/usr/bin/php"
msgstr "<function>@execBegin</function>#!/usr/bin/php"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The first one uses the name of the <acronym>PHP</acronym> executable. "
"&kommander; searches PATH for <application>php</application> and if it is "
"not found looks to see if it is registered with &kommander; in a location "
"outside of your path. If not it tells the user it cannot be found. The "
"second examples uses the classic <quote>shebang</quote> which can have some "
"benefits and also problems. If you have a beta copy of <acronym>PHP5</"
"acronym>, for instance, in <filename>/usr/local/bin</filename> which would "
"not be found because it would find on in <filename>/usr/bin</filename> this "
"is useful. If, however, you distribute the dialog to someone who has "
"<acronym>PHP</acronym> in <filename>/usr/local/bin</filename> only it will "
"not be found with the shebang used. So using shebangs is cautioned and using "
"the executable is recommended if you are sharing files."
msgstr ""
"Prvi koristi naziv <acronym>PHP</acronym> executable. &kommander; traži put "
"za <application>php</application> i ako ga ne nađe gleda da li je "
"registrovan sa &kommander; na lokaciji izvan vašeg puta. Ako nije govori "
"korisniku da ne može biti nađen. Drugi primjer koristi klasični  "
"<quote>shebang</quote> koji može imati neke prednosti ali i probleme. Ako "
"imate beta kopiju <acronym>PHP5</acronym>, na primjer, u <filename>/usr/"
"local/bin</filename>  koji se ne bi našao jer bi se našao u  <filename>/usr/"
"bin</filename> ovo je korisno. Ako, međutim proslijedite dialog nekome ko "
"ima <acronym>PHP</acronym> u <filename>/usr/local/bin</filename> ne bi bio "
"pronađen unutar shebanga koji se koristi. Upotreba shebanga je rizična a "
"upotreba executable je preporučena ako dijelite fajlove."

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid "@global(<parameter>variable</parameter>)"
msgstr "@global(<parameter>variable</parameter>)"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid "expands to the value of the specified global variable."
msgstr "proširuje na vrijednost navedene globalne varijable."

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:95
#, no-c-format
msgid "@null"
msgstr "@null"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Returns null. Now that Kommander checks for empty widgetText on execution "
"this will prevent erroneous errors in the case of an unset state on a widget."
msgstr ""
"Vraća nulu. Sada kada Kommander provjerava na prazna widgetText pri "
"izvršavanju ovo će spriječiti pogrešne greške u slučaju nepostavljenog "
"slučaja na widgetu."

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:102
#, no-c-format
msgid "@parentPid"
msgstr "@parentPid"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:104
#, no-c-format
msgid "The &PID; of the parent process."
msgstr "&PID; roditeljevog procesa."

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:111
#, no-c-format
msgid "@pid"
msgstr "@pid"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid "The &PID; of the process."
msgstr "&PID; procesa."

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:120
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"@readSetting(<parameter>key</parameter>, <parameter>defaultValue</parameter>)"
msgstr ""
"@readSetting(<parameter>key</parameter>, <parameter>defaultValue</parameter>)"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:122
#, no-c-format
msgid "reads a value from <filename>kommanderrc</filename>"
msgstr "čita vrijednost sa <filename>kommanderrc</filename>"

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:129
#, no-c-format
msgid "@selectedWidgetText"
msgstr "@selectedWidgetText"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:131
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"the selected content in a widget that can show more than one value, like "
"list widgets"
msgstr ""
"označeni sadržaj u widget koji može da prikaže više od jedne vrijednosti, "
"kao lista widgetsa."

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:138
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"@setGlobal(<parameter>variable</parameter>, <parameter>value</parameter>)"
msgstr ""
"@setGlobal(<parameter>variable</parameter>, <parameter>value</parameter>)"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:140
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sets the global variable to the specified value."
msgstr "Postavlja globalnu varijablu na specificiranu vrijednost."

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:147
#, no-c-format
msgid "@widgetText"
msgstr "@widgetText"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:149
#, no-c-format
msgid "the content of a widget"
msgstr "sadržaj widgeta"

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:156
#, no-c-format
msgid "@writeSetting(<parameter>key</parameter>, <parameter>value</parameter>)"
msgstr ""
"@writeSetting(<parameter>key</parameter>, <parameter>value</parameter>)"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:158
#, no-c-format
msgid "write value to <filename>kommanderrc</filename>"
msgstr "zapiši vrijednost na <filename>kommanderrc</filename>"

#. Tag: title
#: specials.docbook:166
#, no-c-format
msgid "Array Function Group"
msgstr "Niz funkcija grupe"

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:170
#, no-c-format
msgid "@Array.values(<parameter>array</parameter>)"
msgstr "@Array.values(<parameter>array</parameter>)"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:172
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Returns an EOL-separated list of all values in the array. Can be used to "
"walk through an array."
msgstr ""
"Vraća EOL razdvojenu listu svih vrijednosti u nizu. Može se koristiti za "
"kretanje kroz niz."

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:177
#, no-c-format
msgid "@Array.keys(<parameter>array</parameter>)"
msgstr "@Array.keys(<parameter>array</parameter>)"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:179
#, no-c-format
msgid "Returns an EOL-separated list of all keys in the array."
msgstr "Vraća listu razdvojenu EOL-ima svih ključeva u nizu."

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:184
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"@Array.setValue(<parameter>array</parameter>, <parameter>key</parameter>, "
"<parameter>value</parameter>)"
msgstr ""
"@Array.setValue(<parameter>array</parameter>, <parameter>key</parameter>, "
"<parameter>value</parameter>)"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:186
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Sets a key and value for an element of an array. If no array exists it is "
"created."
msgstr ""
"Postavlja ključ i vrijednost za element niza. Ako niz ne postoji kreira se."

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:191
#, no-c-format
msgid "@Array.clear(<parameter>array</parameter>)"
msgstr "@Array.clear(<parameter>array</parameter>)"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:193
#, no-c-format
msgid "Remove all elements from the array."
msgstr "Ukloni sve elemente iz niza."

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:198
#, no-c-format
msgid "@Array.count(<parameter>array</parameter>)"
msgstr "@Array.count(<parameter>array</parameter>)"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:200
#, no-c-format
msgid "Return number of elements in the array."
msgstr "Vrati broj elemenata u nizu."

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:205
#, no-c-format
msgid "@Array.value(<parameter>array</parameter>,<parameter>key</parameter>)"
msgstr "@Array.value(<parameter>array</parameter>,<parameter>key</parameter>)"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:207
#, no-c-format
msgid "Return the value associated with the given key."
msgstr "Vrati vrijednost vezanu za dati ključ."

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:212
#, no-c-format
msgid "@Array.remove(<parameter>array</parameter>,<parameter>key</parameter>)"
msgstr "@Array.remove(<parameter>array</parameter>,<parameter>key</parameter>)"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:214
#, no-c-format
msgid "Remove element with the given key from the array."
msgstr "Ukloni element vezan za dati ključ iz niza."

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:219
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"@Array.fromString(<parameter>array</parameter>,<parameter>string</parameter>)"
msgstr ""
"@Array.fromString(<parameter>array</parameter>,<parameter>string</parameter>)"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:221
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Add all elements in the string to the array. String should have <emphasis>key"
"\\tvalue\\n</emphasis> format.\""
msgstr ""
"Dodaj sve elemente  stringa u niz. String bi treba biti formata <emphasis>key"
"\\tvalue\\n</emphasis> format."

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:226
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"@Array.toString(<parameter>array</parameter>,<parameter>string</parameter>)"
msgstr ""
"@Array.toString(<parameter>array</parameter>,<parameter>string</parameter>)"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:228
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"\"Return all elements in the array in <emphasis>key\\tvalue\\n</emphasis> "
"format.\""
msgstr "Vrati sve elemente niza u <emphasis>key\\tvalue\\n</emphasis> format."

#. Tag: title
#: specials.docbook:236
#, no-c-format
msgid "File Function Group"
msgstr "Grupa fajlovskih funkcija."

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:240
#, no-c-format
msgid "@File.read(<parameter>file</parameter>)"
msgstr "@File.read(<parameter>file</parameter>)"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:242
#, no-c-format
msgid "Return content of the given file."
msgstr "Vrati sadržaj date datoteke."

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:247
#, no-c-format
msgid "@File.write(<parameter>file</parameter><parameter>string</parameter>)"
msgstr "@File.write(<parameter>file</parameter><parameter>string</parameter>)"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:249
#, no-c-format
msgid "Write given string to a file."
msgstr "Upiši dati znakovni niz u datoteku."

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:254
#, no-c-format
msgid "@File.append(<parameter>file</parameter><parameter>string</parameter>)"
msgstr "@File.append(<parameter>file</parameter><parameter>string</parameter>)"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:256
#, no-c-format
msgid "Append given string to the end of a file."
msgstr "Prikači dati znakovni niz na kraj datoteke."

#. Tag: title
#: specials.docbook:264
#, no-c-format
msgid "String Function Group"
msgstr "Grupa funkcija za niz znakova"

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:268
#, no-c-format
msgid "@String.length(<parameter>string</parameter>)"
msgstr "@String.length(<parameter>string</parameter>)"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:270
#, no-c-format
msgid "Return number of chars in the string."
msgstr "Vrati broj znakova u znakovnom nizu."

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:275
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"@String.contains(<parameter>string</parameter>,<parameter>substring</"
"parameter>)"
msgstr ""
"@String.contains(<parameter>string</parameter>,<parameter>substring</"
"parameter>)"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:277
#, no-c-format
msgid "Check if the string contains given substring."
msgstr "Provjeri da li znakovni niz sadrži dati podniz."

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:282
#, no-c-format
msgid "@String.find(<parameter>string</parameter>)"
msgstr "@String.find(<parameter>string</parameter>)"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:284
#, no-c-format
msgid "Return position of a substring in the string, or -1 if it isn't found."
msgstr "Vrati položaj podniza u znakovnom nizu, ili -1 ako nije pronađen."

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:285
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This will have an optional integer start position for find next uses in "
"Alpha 6."
msgstr "Ovo će postaviti dodatni cijeli broj za pretragu u Alfa 6"

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:290
#, no-c-format
msgid "@String.left(<parameter>string</parameter>, <parameter>int</parameter>)"
msgstr ""
"@String.left(<parameter>string</parameter>, <parameter>int</parameter>)"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:292
#, no-c-format
msgid "Return first n chars of the string."
msgstr "Vrati prvih n znakova znakovnog niza."

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:297
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"@String.right(<parameter>string</parameter>, <parameter>int</parameter>)"
msgstr ""
"@String.right(<parameter>string</parameter>, <parameter>int</parameter>)"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:299
#, no-c-format
msgid "Return last n chars of the string."
msgstr "Vrati posljednjih n znakova znakovnog niza."

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:304
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"@String.mid(<parameter>string</parameter>, <parameter>int start</parameter>, "
"<parameter>int end</parameter>)"
msgstr ""
"@String.mid(<parameter>string</parameter>, <parameter>int start</parameter>, "
"<parameter>int end</parameter>)"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:306
#, no-c-format
msgid "Return substring of the string, starting from given position."
msgstr "Vrati podniz znakovnog niza, počev od datog položaja."

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:311
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"@String.remove(<parameter>string</parameter>, <parameter>substring</"
"parameter>)"
msgstr ""
"@String.remove(<parameter>string</parameter>, <parameter>substring</"
"parameter>)"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:313
#, no-c-format
msgid "Remove all occurences of a given substring."
msgstr "Uklonite sve pojave datog podniza."

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:318
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"@String.replace(<parameter>string</parameter>, <parameter>substring find</"
"parameter>, <parameter>substring replace</parameter>)"
msgstr ""
"@String.replace(<parameter>string</parameter>, <parameter>substring find</"
"parameter>, <parameter>substring replace</parameter>)"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:320
#, no-c-format
msgid "Replace all occurences of a given substring with a given replacement."
msgstr "Zamijeni sve pojave datog podniza sa datom zamjenom."

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:325
#, no-c-format
msgid "@String.upper(<parameter>string</parameter>)"
msgstr "@String.upper(<parameter>string</parameter>)"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:327
#, no-c-format
msgid "Convert the string to uppercase."
msgstr "Pretvori sva mala slova u znakovnom nizu u velika."

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:332
#, no-c-format
msgid "@String.lower(<parameter>string</parameter>)"
msgstr "@String.lower(<parameter>string</parameter>)"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:334
#, no-c-format
msgid "Convert the string to lowercase."
msgstr "Pretvori sva velika slova u znakovnom nizu u mala."

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:339
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"@String.compare(<parameter>string</parameter>, <parameter>string</parameter>)"
msgstr ""
"@String.compare(<parameter>string</parameter>, <parameter>string</parameter>)"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:341
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Compare two strings. Return 0 if they are equal, -1 if the first one is "
"lower, 1 if the first one is higher"
msgstr ""
"Uporedi dva znakovna niza. Vrati 0 ako su jednaki, -1 ako je prvi manji, 1 "
"ako je prvi veći"

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:346
#, no-c-format
msgid "@String.isEmpty(<parameter>string</parameter>)"
msgstr "@String.isEmpty(<parameter>string</parameter>)"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:348
#, no-c-format
msgid "Check if string is empty."
msgstr "Provjeri da li je znakovni niz prazan."

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:353
#, no-c-format
msgid "@String.isNumber(<parameter>string</parameter>)"
msgstr "@String.isNumber(<parameter>string</parameter>)"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:355
#, no-c-format
msgid "Check if string is a valid number."
msgstr "Provjeri da li je znakovni niz ispravan broj."

#. Tag: title
#: specials.docbook:363
#, no-c-format
msgid "Built-in Globals"
msgstr "Ugrađeni Globali."

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:364
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Built-in globals are accessed just like regular global variables with "
"<function>@global</function>."
msgstr ""
"Ugrađenim globalima se pristupa isto kao i običnim globalnim varijablama sa "
"<function>@global</function>."

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:367
#, no-c-format
msgid "@global(_KDDIR)"
msgstr "@global(_KDDIR)"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:369
#, no-c-format
msgid "The directory the current dialog is in."
msgstr "Direktorija trenutnog dijaloga."

#. Tag: function
#: specials.docbook:373
#, no-c-format
msgid "@global(_NAME)"
msgstr "@global(_NAME)"

#. Tag: para
#: specials.docbook:374
#, no-c-format
msgid "The name of the dialog"
msgstr "Ime dijaloga"
